From 5094535c61659e403435ea1198ec83f091e19b22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:22:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(od-sevev): Bibi's court-day exit and return, the
 court-window echo, a leader walk helper
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The Magician zips off screen-left when testimony begins, his hat hovers on
his mark and takes the taps, then fetches him back (state-graph-magician
§1.3, §3, §5), Bibi's rounds only. The courthouse window lights with
suspicion and breathes while the court window is open. LeaderWalk is
prepared for the election swap and not wired. Also fixes the web game
never following prefers-reduced-motion (the bridge returns 1, not true).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JZ6f2h5tcXVKGAwuAga5z8
